@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 0
left to right direction
title YouRun · 本机进程与存储
node "用户设备" {
  node "GUI 宿主（可多开）" as GUI <<process>> {
    artifact "MyGo WebView / Wails + React\n或 MyGo Native" as UI
    component "desktop.Host\n127.0.0.1:随机端口" as Host
    component "工作区服务 / 执行控制器" as GUIController
    UI --> Host : HTTP / SSE
    Host --> GUIController
  }
  node "yourun CLI" as CLI <<process>> {
    component "工作区服务 / 执行控制器" as CLIController
  }
  node "每次执行的 _execute" as Worker <<process>>
  node "Shell + 命令子进程" as Command <<processGroup>>
  folder "用户数据目录" {
    database "command-manager.sqlite3\n应用定义 / 历史 / 设置 / 元数据" as DB
    artifact "executions/<id>/\nmanifest.json · state.json\nowner.lock · stop.json（按需）" as Records
    artifact "logs/<id>.log" as Logs
    artifact "project-avatars/\n头像文件" as Avatars
  }
  folder "用户项目目录" as Projects
}
GUIController --> DB
CLIController --> DB : 需要应用数据时
GUIController --> Records
CLIController --> Records
GUIController ..> Worker : 启动
CLIController ..> Worker : 启动
Worker --> Records : 状态与停止控制
Worker --> Command : 启动 / 控制句柄
Command --> Logs : 直接持有文件句柄
Command --> Projects : 工作目录
Host --> Avatars
Host --> Projects : 静态发现
CLIController --> Projects : 静态发现
note bottom of Worker
  直接执行现有程序，不复制二进制到数据目录
  不打开 SQLite；无中央常驻执行服务
end note
@enduml
